OL,3,GNEWSAHospital concerns ignored for 15
OL,4,Ayears, scientist tells inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scientist involved in the development
OL,7,Fof Scotland's super-hospital has
OL,8,Fclaimed his concerns over patient
OL,9,Fsafety were repeatedly ignored.
OL,11,FDr Michael Bradnam told the Scottish
OL,12,FHospitals Inquiry he had spent 15 years
OL,13,Fraising issues with ventilation
OL,14,Fsystems, electrical safety and humidity
OL,15,Fcontrol at the Queen Elizabeth
OL,16,FUniversity Hospital (QEUH) campus in
OL,17,FGlasgow.
